# Bola de Domingo

Niche stays on Sunday football across Brazil, read from São Paulo. Do not turn this site into an official club site, a CBF table, or a player-roster property.

- Name: Bola de Domingo. Folder: `boladedomingo.com`.
- Brand: page `#F1EFEA`, asphalt `#231910`, accent `#9A3412`, highlight `#5B4636`. Newsreader + Outfit. Initials: BD.
- Look is a sports-news desk: dark utility bar, panel masthead, asphalt section nav, inline score ticker, lead plus headline rail, stat strip, note cards, fixture list, league table, asphalt newsletter, three-column footer. Newsreader for headlines, Outfit for body. Keep the same sections.
- Language: Portuguese (`pt-BR`) only. `/en`, `/pt`, and `/es` 308 back to the unprefixed path.
- Category: Football. Niche: Sunday football across Brazil. Vertical: Sports. Desk city: São Paulo, Brasil.
- Coverage: praças (Largo do Apito, Campinho da Tarde, Areia do Domingo, Terreiro do Apito, Rampa da Tarde, Calçada do Sol) and Circuito da Tarde (Relógio da Manhã, Viaduto da Tarde, Feira do Domingo, Mercado da Tarde, Estação do Apito, Orla do Domingo, Ponte da Tarde, Alto do Domingo).
- Scores ship only when a mesa could sign them. The seleção week is context. Do not add CBF, Brasileirão, Copa do Brasil, Libertadores, or club official tables, and do not add chat-rumor results.
- Do not publish rosters, especially of minors. Count the game by praça, tarde, and signed score.
- Package manager: yarn. No `package-lock.json`.
- Arrow functions only. Interfaces are `I`-prefixed. Enums are `Enum`-suffixed. Component props are `I*Props` and destructured inside the arrow.
- Component files are PascalCase (`HomeView.tsx`). Other modules are camelCase (`newsletter.ts`). App route folders stay the public URL slug. Next reserved files stay their required names (`not-found.tsx`, `opengraph-image.tsx`).
- Husky 9.1.7: `prepare` is `husky`, `precommit` is `yarn lint && yarn build`, `.husky/pre-commit` and `.husky/pre-push` run `yarn precommit`.
- Seed content: `src/data/domingo.ts`. Tables are derived from signed fixtures.
- Points: win 3, draw 1. Column GP is goals for. Column SG is goal difference. Rodada da Copa does not enter the Taça de Domingo table.
- Newsletter client: `src/lib/newsletter.ts`. POST `{ email, website }` to the CMS `subscriptions/subscribe` (`NEXT_PUBLIC_CMS_URL` or `https://api.football360brazil.com/api`). Website is the apex host. Send the email as typed. 201 and 200 confirm; already subscribed is an error message. Timeout 10s. Footer and homepage forms use React Hook Form.
- Sports client uses TanStack Query and Axios HttpService. Desk pages render seed until `/articles`, `/matches`, and `/standings` return data.
- Keep this palette. Do not reuse the sibling desks' blush, crimson, teal, steel, sage, pine, sand, rose, gold, or chartreuse, and do not reuse the Guanabara bay-mist sheet.
